  "intraday_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-74ce47c08c4a",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 09:34:00 EDT",
      "text": "開盤大K線 上下可以Limit order",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T06:54:50.987684+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T06:54:50.987691+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-175511f6b453",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 09:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "空Limit 拿到下1/3",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T06:56:26.851323+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T06:56:26.851332+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-5b92ca24c6cc",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 09:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊TR 波幅中等 有機會拿BO但可以等Confirm bar 後的PB",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T06:57:30.732814+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T06:58:20.417317+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-998df98bd542",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 09:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "空方BO failed 看下一根",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T06:58:30.359291+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T06:58:30.359298+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-770949fa8c2f",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 10:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "多方拿反彈50%後空方再次BO\n1. 等micro DB + 10點反轉\n2. 前低Limit賭Bo 失敗",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T06:59:45.283746+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T06:59:45.283753+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-10ad3c1e2d93",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 10:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "SB 沒有很好可以等E2\n或是看Confirm bar的波幅",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:01:11.213081+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:01:11.213090+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-ae7f150aada3",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 10:24:00 EDT",
      "text": "目前到12點以前應該還會在這個區間震盪\n或是震盪下跌這邊嘗試拿到1R或前高附近",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:02:37.028726+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:02:37.028735+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-81cde155225d",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 10:44:00 EDT",
      "text": "1m WBO first MM都沒拿到，多方有點弱嘗試BE位置離場",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:04:12.409755+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:04:12.409766+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-d8b3409ca110",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 10:53:00 EDT",
      "text": "打停損 等12點",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:05:14.738610+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:05:14.738619+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-f62f6569fdce",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 11:23:00 EDT",
      "text": "目前波幅達到了，有機會12點反轉\n1. 等Confirm bar\n2. TTR BO long stop",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:06:28.834500+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:06:28.834509+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-2e4f688729b7",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 12:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "12點 Confirm沒有拿到1R、前高位置\n但是 TTR BO的已經拿到1R\n在整段50%開始震盪 有可能向下反轉半區震盪\n在這個TTR高點離場",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:08:14.202261+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:09:43.889399+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-4c97027a2fdb",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 12:29:00 EDT",
      "text": "用Short Limit 賭TTR BO、下半區震盪拿到下1/3+1R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:10:59.680279+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:10:59.680286+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-e98dbdc344d6",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 12:44:00 EDT",
      "text": "突破失敗可以選擇BE 或是 守SL",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:11:59.558689+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:11:59.558695+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-165d7ff8feb7",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 12:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "SL後 Bull BO failed 有機會再試一次\n等Confirm bar 或 SB Stop order",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:13:26.224679+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:13:26.224686+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-6fbfe1ece0a0",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 13:46:00 EDT",
      "text": "TTR下緣震盪、Confirm bar 2R可以離場\n或是拿TTR BO 1R 等這個震盪再次突破",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:14:49.044202+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:14:49.044213+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-f516295e6929",
      "replay_time": "2026-08-18 13:57:00 EDT",
      "text": "拿到TTR BO 1R、半區的下1/3",
      "created_at": "2026-09-23T07:15:13.608570+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-23T07:15:40.761578+00:00"
    }
  ],
